.TH XIL\-SFX "1" "2026\-08\-09" "xil\-pipeline 0.3.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xil\-sfx
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xil\-sfx
[-h] (--episode EPISODE | --tag TAG) [--show SHOW] [--script SCRIPT] [--dry-run] [--max-duration MAX_DURATION] [--gen-sfx] [--gen-music] [--gen-ambience] [--sfx-music] [--local-only] [--sfx-backend BACKEND] [--mmaudio-python PATH] [--mmaudio-duration FLOAT] [--mmaudio-cfg FLOAT] [--mmaudio-steps INT] [--mmaudio-negative-prompt STR] [--mmaudio-seed INT] [--mmaudio-accept-noncommercial]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate SFX stems from an SFX config (standalone utility)

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI\,EPISODE\/\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S01E01) — derives cast and SFX config paths

.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI\,TAG\/\fR
Raw tag for non\-episodic content (e.g. V01C03, D01)

.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI\,SHOW\/\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)

.TP
\fB\-\-script\fR \fI\,SCRIPT\/\fR
Path to parsed script JSON (default: derived from cast config)

.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview existing vs. new stems and estimated credit cost

.TP
\fB\-\-max\-duration\fR \fI\,MAX_DURATION\/\fR
Only process effects with duration_seconds <= this value

.TP
\fB\-\-gen\-sfx\fR
Limit to SFX and BEAT entries only

.TP
\fB\-\-gen\-music\fR
Limit to MUSIC entries only

.TP
\fB\-\-gen\-ambience\fR
Limit to AMBIENCE entries only

.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\-music\fR
(deprecated) shorthand for \-\-gen\-sfx \-\-gen\-music \-\-gen\-ambience

.TP
\fB\-\-local\-only\fR
Only place stems for effects already present in SFX/; skip API generation

.TP
\fB\-\-sfx\-backend\fR \fI\,BACKEND\/\fR
Backend for SFX/music/ambience generation, independent of the dialogue
\-\-backend. 'elevenlabs' (default) calls the ElevenLabs Sound Effects API.
'mmaudio' runs MMAudio locally in venv\-mmaudio — free and GPU\-accelerated,
writes backend\-tagged assets to SFX/<slug>.mmaudio.mp3. MMAudio's weights are
CC BY\-NC 4.0 (non\-commercial only) and require \-\-mmaudio\-accept\-noncommercial.

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-python\fR \fI\,PATH\/\fR
Path to the Python executable in the MMAudio venv (default: auto\-detect
./venv\-mmaudio/bin/python3). Used only with \-\-sfx\-backend mmaudio.

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-duration\fR \fI\,FLOAT\/\fR
Generation length in seconds before trimming (default: 8.0, MMAudio's training
duration). The result is trimmed to each cue's duration_seconds; generating at
the native length and trimming gives better audio than asking for a short
clip.

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-cfg\fR \fI\,FLOAT\/\fR
MMAudio classifier\-free guidance strength (default: 4.5).

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-steps\fR \fI\,INT\/\fR
MMAudio flow\-matching sampling steps (default: 25).

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-negative\-prompt\fR \fI\,STR\/\fR
Optional MMAudio negative prompt (default: none).

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-seed\fR \fI\,INT\/\fR
MMAudio reproducibility seed (default: nondeterministic).

.TP
\fB\-\-mmaudio\-accept\-noncommercial\fR
Acknowledge that MMAudio's weights are CC BY\-NC 4.0 (NON\-COMMERCIAL USE ONLY)
and that generated audio must not appear in a monetised production. Required
for \-\-sfx\-backend mmaudio.

